<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S3.SS2" title="In 3 Methodology ‣ SteeringControl: Holistic Evaluation of Alignment Steering in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.2 </span>Steering Methods</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
